<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 600.88, up 3.84.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 294 to 251.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.08.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,646,910 compared with 20,085,660 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
